# D-2: pick's degenerate cases, named and exercised.
mode fly
weather pin 0.10 0.0
weather time 0

log ===== 1. TERRAIN vs WATER in the same frame (pond_country, world reel pose)
teleport -0.798 -67.941 0.150
look 40 -35
shot degen_pond
pick 639.5 359.5
pick 200 620
pick 1100 300

log ===== 2. SKY: the ray clears every body
look 40 40
pick 639.5 359.5
pick 0 0

log ===== 3. HORIZON: sweeping pitch through the horizon dip from 300 km
log ===== (dip = acos(R/(R+h)) = 15.13 deg, so -14 is sky and -16 is ground)
teleport 0 20 300
look 0 -14
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -15
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -15.2
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -16
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -20
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -40
pick 639.5 359.5
look 0 -85
pick 639.5 359.5

log ===== 4. MOON: focus it and pick its disc, then land and pick the ground
focus moon
pick 639.5 359.5
pick 300 200
pick 20 20
moonland 10 25 0 -20
pick 639.5 500
